{"id":"MM-489","title":"OAuth: resolve client metadata at /oauth/authorize on cache miss — non-PAR clients (pckt.blog) get "client_id is not registered"","description":"Diagnosed live 2026-07-27 with [pckt.blog](<http://pckt.blog>): its Laravel backend never uses PAR — it sends a direct `GET /oauth/authorize?client_id=https://pckt.blog/oauth-client-metadata.json&…`. In Custos, live client-metadata resolution happens only inside `/oauth/par`; the authorize endpoint's `lookup_and_validate_client` is a DB-cache lookup only, so a never-PARed client hits the "client_id is not registered with this server" error page. Their metadata document is valid and fetchable.

[pckt.blog](<http://pckt.blog>) is technically nonconformant (the atproto OAuth spec still says clients must use PAR), but [bsky.social](<http://bsky.social>) tolerates direct authorization requests ([pckt.blog](<http://pckt.blog>) works there), and the spec anticipates relaxing PAR to optional.

Fix: on an authorize-endpoint client-lookup miss for a URL-shaped `client_id`, resolve the metadata document live (reuse `auth::oauth_client_resolution::resolve_client_metadata`) and cache it, matching reference-provider leniency for direct (non-PAR) authorization requests.","priority":{"value":2,"name":"High"},"url":"https://linear.app/malpercio/issue/MM-489/oauth-resolve-client-metadata-at-oauthauthorize-on-cache-miss-non-par","gitBranchName":"malpercio/mm-489-oauth-resolve-client-metadata-at-oauthauthorize-on-cache","createdAt":"2026-07-27T23:43:39.139Z","updatedAt":"2026-07-27T23:43:39.139Z","archivedAt":null,"completedAt":null,"startedAt":"2026-07-27T23:43:39.248Z","canceledAt":null,"dueDate":null,"slaStartedAt":null,"slaMediumRiskAt":null,"slaHighRiskAt":null,"slaBreachesAt":null,"slaType":"all","status":"In Progress","statusType":"started","labels":["Wave 2: Auth"],"attachments":[],"documents":[],"createdBy":"Malpercio","createdById":"5af222b1-08a6-485f-b6e6-26ff3fcff509","assignee":"Malpercio","assigneeId":"5af222b1-08a6-485f-b6e6-26ff3fcff509","project":"ezpds","projectId":"2b0ca2e9-cd15-4ab2-8a55-1efad70eb8a1","team":"Mal's Machinations","teamId":"9278a20f-995f-49ab-b09d-a340fdcaea72"}

